# Vendored greateyes SDK — keep exactly as the vendor shipped it.
#
# core.autocrlf is true on the MAST machines, which would rewrite the wrapper's
# CRLF endings to LF in the blob and break byte-for-byte comparison against the
# upstream archive. `-text` disables EOL conversion so the sha256 recorded in
# cameras/greateyes/sdk/VENDOR.md verifies directly against a fresh checkout.
cameras/greateyes/sdk/greateyesSDK.py -text

# The SDK DLL must never be touched by EOL or diff heuristics.
cameras/greateyes/sdk/lib/** binary
